# BUGS

A port listened on stays open, and its thread blocked in a read, until the program ends: there is no `stopListening`.
Views and embedding, secure surfaces, accessibility trees and a program's own buffers are not in the SDK yet, and neither are audio, threads with intents, or drag and drop.
Key repeat is not given (`isRepeat` is never set), since Radharc has none.
Every window is at 1×.
